# Build output and generated artefacts
dist
coverage
node_modules
package-lock.json

# Binary and hand-authored assets
public

# Markdown is deliberately excluded. Prettier normalises list markers and
# emphasis characters, which would rewrite most of README.md, PRIVACY.md and
# SECURITY.md for no functional gain and bury their real history under a
# whole-file reformat.
*.md

# Note on line endings: .prettierrc.json uses endOfLine "auto" rather than
# "lf". core.autocrlf is true on Windows checkouts, so the working tree is CRLF
# while .gitattributes (* text=auto) stores LF in the repository. Pinning "lf"
# made prettier --check flag every file locally while passing in CI, which makes
# the check useless to the person most likely to run it.
